                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't know how Kiwiforge does it!\r\n\r\nJust a fun little first-person platformer where jumps are power ups instead of something you can do whenever you want.\r\n\r\nThat might not sound like the most intuitive thing the world, but somehow the developer pulls it off.\r\n\r\nFun game with a nice flow, level variety, gimmick variety, and length.\r\n\r\nPlayed it way back when it came out and just gave it another run through and it was just as fun as I remembered!",
